<title>UK: Norwich shares seen opening at 340p - 350p.</title>
<headline>Norwich shares seen opening at 340p - 350p.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Norwich Union Plc were seen opening at between 340p and 350p on Monday, as the former mutually-owned insurance group makes its market debut, dealers said.</p>
<p>That will give an immediate hefty profit to investors and policy holders, who qualified for free shares and were also able to apply for extra stock.</p>
<p>Norwich on Sunday said it priced its public offer of shares at 290p, at the top of the range of previous estimates, while members will pay 265p.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
